  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Add the water to a medium saucepan and bring to the boil.\n• Add jasmine rice, stir, cover with a lid and reduce heat to low.\n• Cook for 10 minutes, then remove the pan from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and all the water is absorbed, 10 minutes. TIP: The rice will finish cooking in its own steam so don't peek!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68340175f7d5496ac4a5fe2a/step-bad5ca00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, thinly slice cucumber into rounds. Using a vegetable peeler, slice carrot into ribbons.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68340175f7d5496ac4a5fe2a/step-b2888610.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with enough olive oil to coat the base.\n• Cook plant-based crumbed chicken until golden and heated through, 2-3 minutes on each side.\n• Add sweet soy seasoning and cook, turning to coat, until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Transfer to a plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68340175f7d5496ac4a5fe2a/step-27920820.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Wash out frying pan and return to medium-high heat.\n• Stir in katsu paste and coconut milk until slightly thickened, 2-3 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68340175f7d5496ac4a5fe2a/step-578b8130.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium bowl, combine carrot ribbons, mixed salad leaves, a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil. Season to taste.\n• Once rice is done, add the vinegar (for the rice) and a pinch of sugar. Stir to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68340175f7d5496ac4a5fe2a/step-8dfd8e40.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Slice crumbed chick'n.\n• Bring everything to the table.\n• Build your own plate with crumbed sweet soy plant-based crumbed chicken, cheat's sushi rice, cucumber rounds, carrot ribbon salad, golden curry sauce and sesame seeds.\n• If you've selected an add on bundle, serve with garlic and chilli Asian greens. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68340175f7d5496ac4a5fe2a/step-6a302850.jpg"
    }
  ]
